window.products.push({"id":305045,"name":"Finew 6pcs Glass Cups with Bamboo Lids and Glass Straws, 16oz Beer Glasses Can Shaped Glass Cups, Clear Glass Cups, Cute Tumbler Cup, Ideal for Whiske","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p+aQuYp1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【6 PACK BEER CAN GLASS】The 16oz drinking glass set includes 6 * beer can shaped glass cups, 6 *bamboo lids, 6 * reusable straws and 2 *cleaning brushes. No extra buying of these items to effortlessly get ins-style drinking glass cups. So if you’re looking for cool glassware to make all kinds of drinks look super cute, go beer can glass cups! 【FOOD-GRADE TUMBLER & DURABLE GLASSES】Made of superior thicker borosilicate glass, ice coffee tumbler cups are crystal-clear, lead-free and BPA-free, safe for kids. Good for both hot and cold drinks.The rims of 16 oz can glass has perfect smooth curvature and thickness, which allowing your lip enjoy your cool drinks and feel comfortable. Plus, our funny beer glasses are durable and easy to clean. 【TRENDY CLEAR CAN SHAPE GLASS】Replicating beer can shape, the glass cup keep rich foam and aroma of beer while allows for a beautiful display for all beverages. Great for any beer,whiskey , cocktail, cola, water, soda, iced coffee... Those cute ice coffee cups with lids are highly appreciated in the fashionable brewery, bars and restaurants. With these stylish crystal clear glass cups set, your party will look more attractive and dynamic. 【BEST GIFTS FOR WOMEN】The clear can glass cups with lids and straws is fashionable, beautiful and special. You are free to DIY paste your favorite stickers. Mother's Day, birthday, Christmas, Valentine’s Day, Thanksgiving, Birthday, Relaxing gift ideas. Best gift for Birthdays, Engagement, Housewarming, Tea Sets, Home Bars, Graduation, Weddings, Bachelorette Parties, Christmas Gifts, or any given occasion. 【100% SATISFIED SERVICE】Your glass tumbler cans 16 oz glasses will arrive bubble wrapped and securely boxed, complete with our robust 180 days Warranty. Finew crafted can glass never won’t let you down. If the can-shaped glass set you received was damaged or imperfect or you are not 100% satisfied, please simply contact us, we will offer a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p+aQuYp1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Finew","source_asin":"B0B65DHK1J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B65DHK1J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B65DHK1J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305046,"name":"Electric Jar Opener, Restaurant Automatic Jar Opener for Seniors with Arthritis, Weak Hands, Bottle Opener for Arthritic Hands (JAR OPENER-new)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Operating the Can Opener Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can Trouble Shooting 1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. 3. If the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of the can opener. Note: 1) Use 2 new batteries ( High quality AA batteries), cheaper less quality new batteries are inadequate and may not preform as necessary. 2) After completely revolving around the can and cutting the edge, the can will still appear to be sealed. After prying up the lid will it be evident that the can and its resealable lid are detached. 3) Do not lift or forcefully remove the can opener from the can while it is operational. Forceful removal can cause damage to the knife-edge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handupfree","source_asin":"B07KWCPX41","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KWCPX41","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KWCPX41","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
