window.products.push({"id":305056,"name":"XTX Pillows for Sleeping Memory Foam Pillow, Cervical Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain Relief, Ergonomic Orthopedic Contour Support Pillow for Side S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1PzJkvITDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CONTOUR PILLOW-The neck pillow with upgraded butterfly-shape ergonomic design perfectly fits the contours of your head, neck and shoulders, which will support your neck and align your head with the rest of your body and spine. The cervical pillow for neck pain will help to reduce neck pain and alleviate shouldes stiffness, so you will wake up refreshed and ready to take the day. NECK PILLOWS FOR PAIN RELIEF SLEEPING-You can sleep in comfort with the memory foam pillow whether you are a side sleeper, back sleeper or stomach sleeper. A slope in the middle keeps your head from drifting out of position while you sleep. Special cutouts on the sides help provide a comfortable resting place for your arms. The side sleeper pillow will easier to relieve pressure on the spinal tissues and relief the pain in your shoulder and neck. NECK PILLOWS FOR SLEEPING-This orthopedic pillow is made of high density slow rebound memory foam certified by CertiPUR-US. The neck support pillow provides the perfect balance between support and soft, keep your spine stay aligned while soft enough to alleviate pressure. Compared with traditional pillow, memory foam contour pillow allows you to breathe more smoothly and reduce snoring. CERVICAL PILLOW-The pillow covers are breathable, skin-friendly and is OEKO-TEX certified, ensuring providing a healthy and fresh sleeping environment for you. Machine washable pillowcases make it easy to keep your pillow fresh and clean. All material is chemical-free for better health. ERGONOMIC PILLOW-Sound sleep starts with our neck support pillows for sleeping. The exquisite XTX pillow for neck pain is an ideal housewarming gift, birthday gift and holiday gift for parents, friends and relatives, expressing your care to your loved ones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1PzJkvITDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XTX","source_asin":"B09Q2YD7WG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q2YD7WG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q2YD7WG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
