window.products.push({"id":305111,"name":"Air Fryer Silicone Liners for Ninjas Dual, 2 Pack Foldable Silicone Air Fryer Liners Basket Double with Oven Mitts and Brush, Rectangle Air Fryer Pot ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nZB7hUbfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Upgrade Silicone Air Fryer Liner] : Our silicone air fryer basket is compatible with the Ninja Foodi DZ201/DZ401 AF400UK 8QT Air Fryer and is a great alternative to disposable parchment paper. The textured design of these air fryer liners provides optimal airflow for even heat distribution to ensure even cooking, they isolate grease and say goodbye to the hassle of cleaning, making your kitchen life easier! [Food Grade Silicone] : Air fryer silicone pot is made from food grade silicone material, odourless, non-fluorescent, BPA free, non-toxic and 100% healthy. Heat resistant, can withstand temperatures up to 446°F (230°C), does not warp or tear easily, compared to parchment paper liners, our ninja silicone liners does not leak oil, has a high weight bearing capacity and is tear resistant. [Easy to clean and Dishwasher Safe] : Air fryer liners reusable are soft and flexible, and the non-stick material is easy to clean with a brush or in the dishwasher. If you are tired of unsafe and environmentally unfriendly disposable parchment paper, then be sure to try these air fryer silicone liners. [Wide Range of Use] : The air fryer basket is perfect for busy families and saves you time in cleaning. It is not only suitable for air fryers (Ninja Foodi DZ201 DZ401) but also for air fryers, microwaves, ovens, steamers, cookers and more. The liner can also be used for baking, frying, serving food and fruit, making it perfect for home baking, parties, camping, barbecues, parties and more. [Reusable and Foldable] : You will receive two air fryer silicone liners reusable with a pair of silicone gloves and a grease brush. Food grade silicone air fryers are safer compared to disposable parchment paper, heat and temperature resistant, reusable and environmentally friendly. The ninja air fryer silicone liners also protects the inner wall of the fryer and extends the life of the fryer, saving you money and your family will surely praise you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nZB7hUbfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meetory","source_asin":"B0BL3MS7RQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL3MS7RQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL3MS7RQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
