window.products.push({"id":305258,"name":"50-Count Gold Mini Christmas Light Set, 10.2ft Green Wire","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r3tEXhysL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Show your holiday spirit and set the tone to your holiday decor. Use these lights to decorate your tree, wreath or garland. These universal lights can also be used at a wedding, in a bedroom, or to light your railings. Product Features:. Color: gold bulbs / green wire. Number of bulbs on string: 50. Bulb size: mini. Spacing between each bulb: 2.5\". Lighted length: 10.2'. Total length: 11.4'. 12\" lead cord. Wire gauge: 22 Additional product features:. Super bright bulbs. If one bulb burns out, the rest will stay lit. Contains end-to-end connectors which allow you to connect multiple sets together (not to exceed 210 watts). Comes with replacement bulbs, spare fuses and blinker bulbs. UL certified and approved for indoor or outdoor use. 120 volts, 60 hertz, 0.17 amps, 20.4 watts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r3tEXhysL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B00OBZC5DA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OBZC5DA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OBZC5DA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305259,"name":"Cooking Gift Package White 366Pcs 9in 100PCS Air Fryer Liners 9in 100PCS Bamboo Steamer Liners 75Sqft Aluninium Foil 75Sqft Parchment Paper 8in 140Pcs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b1qfl-FYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RCOOVERS are working for research and development of parchment paper ,silicone moldsand other home kitchen supplements for many years. We are striving to make high quality products and provide sincere service to every our customers. 1》The cooking gift pack contains 366Pcs products, which means you can buy more high quality products at a discount price with exquisite gift box packaging. It is a good gift. 2》Premium Material Premium quality food grade baking paper prevents your food sticking on your air fryer with heat resistant up to 220°C/428°F. Ideal for air fryer, steaming basket, cooking fish, vegetables, rice, dim sum, etc.Non stick parchment paper sheets become an indispensable kitchen accessory for air fryers. 3》Aluminum Foil offers trusted strength and quality to handle everyday tasks in your kitchen， This aluminum foil wrap is a time-tested tool that's perfect for lining your baking sheets for baked goods or hot appetizers，Use this tin foil as a quick cover for pans to keep greasy foods or simmering sauces from splattering around your kitchen or keep your counter tops clean while you prepare food. 4》These lace doilies can be applied to dress up a table display and decorate plate, cups, wedding tray, vases, platter, plate, gift bags, cards, etc.The doilies can be easily separated from each other to add more fancy and elegance to your art and craft projects conveniently. 5》Whether you are a beginner or an amateur baker, Rcoovers silicone products must be a good choice for you. And we have been committed to providing customers with high quality products and sincere services., hoping you enjoy the pleasure of DIY baking with your kids and family. Reusable, Environmental-friendly & Durable ，100% Food Grade Silicone ，Flexible＆Easy to Release 6》This cooking gift box is very suitable for family gatherings, birthday parties, outdoor picnics, outdoor barbecues, and food sharing. RCOOVERS leads you to a healthy anffin Cups","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b1qfl-FYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RCOOVERS","source_asin":"B08LBMH7KY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LBMH7KY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LBMH7KY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305260,"name":"Toanel Wood Stove Fan Heat Powered 6 Blades Non Electric Fireplace Fan with Magnetic Thermometer for Wood Gas Burning Stove Pellet Log Burner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Nk3NyJPqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Upgrade Stove Fan]: The design of 6-Blade is not only looks beautiful, but also greatly improves the air circulation efficiency in the room.It is widely used in wood stove, gas stove, Log Burner, Fireplace etc. The effective working distance of a 6-blade stove top fans can reach 3 meters, which is twice the working distance of a 3-blade fan of 1.5 meters. This heat fan designed with thermometer, so that it can detect the working temperature at any time to ensure the safety of the furnace. [Non Electric Fan]: The heat powered stove fan converts heat energy from the stove surface into kinetic energy to spin, and adjust its speed automatically with the stove surface temperature. No batteries or electricity is required. Enjoy the warmth of the room and save on your bills. The range of working temperature is about: 140°F / 60°C~662°F / 350°C, higher the temperature, faster it starts to spin.(Attention: the temperature can not be over 662°F when using the stove fan.) [High-quality Wood Stove Fan]: This fireplace fan base and blade are made from rust-proof anodized aluminum, wear-resisting, with good thermal conductivity. This material is chemically stable, will not decompose and non-toxic. Although working under high temperature for a long time,ecofan will not deformate and discolorate. [Overheat Protection]: The wood stove fan heat powered comes with a bimetallic safety device in the base of the stove fan. It will lift lightly if the working temp is very high,It will lift gently until the temperature drops and the fan will automatically return to normal to protect and extend the life of the fan. [Ultra-Quiet Motor Operating]: The newly designed blade is larger in air volume and lower in noise. The noise level of this wood burning stove fan is less than 25 dB. You will hear virtually no sound at all. It will not interrupt your reading, work, and other activities, you can enjoy the warm air in a quiet and comfortable environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Nk3NyJPqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toanel","source_asin":"B0BJ1NDHCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ1NDHCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ1NDHCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305261,"name":"MCombo Dual Motor Power Lift Recliner Chair with Massage and Heat for Elderly People, Infinite Position, USB Ports, Cup Holders, Extended Footrest, Fa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":739.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HZbJLYwrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【DUAL MOTOR】With the help of built-in dual motor, the chair's backrest and footrest works independently, it means you can adjust to the infinite position you want, lift, TV and lay-flat. (Max reclining angle: 165°) 【Home Button】: When someone knocks on the door, you only need to press the HOME button on the remote control and you will return to upright position in a maximum of \"16\" seconds, no matter what position you are in. In addition, don't worry, when the reclining position is raised, the back will move first to ensure your safety. 【Lumbar Heating & Full-body Vibration】: It comes with 8 vibrating points around the chair and 1 lumbar heating point. By selecting massage intensity and speed, select the vibrating points to relax tired muscles of back or leg. Meanwhile it can also be timed. (The heating function works separately from the vibrating function.) 【Extended Footrest】: The 4.7\" extended footrest will allow you to stretch your body more fully and support your feet well without cutting off circulation. (Recommended Height: 5'3\"-6') 【Expect More】: The dual USB ports and cup holders in the recliner will allow you to put your drink on the cup holder and charge your mobile devices all while enjoying a movie or enjoying your favorite apps. 【About Assemble】: Depending on the unique structure and wiring design, it's simple to assemble the chair, and also no tools needed (20 minutes for a novice). TIPS: 1. Delivery: The chair comes with 2 boxes and we ship them on the same day but the carrier may deliver on different days. 2. If you have any concerns regarding your health, consult your doctor before using the product. 3. Any questions? Contact us now, we will got you within 12 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HZbJLYwrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MCombo","source_asin":"B0BMG25DK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMG25DK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMG25DK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305262,"name":"GhostBed King Cooling Supima Cotton and Tencel Luxury Sheet Set - Wrinkle Resistant with Deep Pockets, 6 Piece, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":175.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oe0UCaC5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COZY UP - Crafted with 60% premium Supima cotton and 40% breathable Tencel, for a silky-soft, cool and comfortable feel COOL DOWN - Tencel is 50% more absorbent than regular cotton sheets and provides a lightweight, airy feel that’s perfect for year-round use STAY SECURE - With deep 18” pockets and our signature 2” GhostGrip elastic band, your sheets stay on securely, all night long; extra large flat sheet provides plenty of coverage EASY CARE - Sheets are wrinkle-resistant and durable, with no annoying pilling like other brands; machine wash on cool or warm, followed by line-drying or a low-heat and low-tumble dryer setting King 6 piece sheet set includes: 1 flat sheet: 106 X 105, 1 fitted sheet: 78 X 80 X 15, 2 queen size pillowcases: 20 X 31, 2 king size pillowcases: 20 X 36","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oe0UCaC5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GhostBed","source_asin":"B08YD9JDRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YD9JDRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YD9JDRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305263,"name":"LOTUS & WINDOWARE Cordless 1\" Vinyl Mini Blind 38\" Wide x 84\" Long, White (MLX3884WH)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gt4XCRtVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vinyl PLEASE NOTE: This blind is 37.5\" wide to allow for mounting the blind inside a 38\" wide window. Each blind will be 1/2-INCH NARROWER than the width ordered to fit inside the window frame. Sizes stated within the product descriptions are listed by width then height. See measuring instructions to ensure best fit. MEASURING INSTRUCTIONS: To determine the width measure inside of the window opening from left to right at the top, middle, and bottom. Record the narrowest measurement. For best fit, find the size with a width closest to your measurement. The height of the blind will be the longest measurement from top to bottom. A blind with a height longer than your recorded measurement will work as the blind can be stopped at any position within the window frame. INSIDE & OUTSIDE MOUNT: This blind is suitable for inside and outside mounting of a window frame. Inside mount means completely installing the blind inside the window frame. For depth it is recommended for the window frame to be at least 1-1/2” deep for a flush inside mount. For mounting outside of the window frame, measure your window opening and add three inches. CORDLESS DESIGN: The new child safe design features a cordless operation lift system eliminating the need for cords allowing the blind to be raised and lowered with just a touch. HARDWARE & INSTRUCTIONS: Your blind will include instructions and hardware for both inside or outside mounting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gt4XCRtVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOTUS & WINDOWARE","source_asin":"B0BY3R3RKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY3R3RKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY3R3RKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
