window.products.push({"id":305419,"name":"Cooling Gel Cervical Neck Pillow for Pain Relief Sleeping – Ventilated Blue Memory Foam - Orthopedic Contour Pillow for Side, Back, Stomach Sleeper - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816QiLvLGHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Best Sleep You’ll Ever Have: You’re tossing and turning, your neck is sore, and you just can’t stay cold or cool with your ordinary pillow - never again with this amazing specialty orthopedic pillow by CushionCare! Our premium PATENTED revolutionary bed pillow has a ventilated memory foam core and a removable cooling gel pad, and is designed to combat all the reasons you never get a full 8 hours of sleep, from eliminating painful pressure points and headaches, to helping to reduce snoring! A Superior Pillow For All Your Needs: This therapeutic contour pillow is made with the highest-quality memory foam, boasting a cooling gel pad and high-density ventilated cooling blue foam core that rebounds quickly. Plus, this high-tech, temperature sensitive foam adjusts to your body’s heat and weight to provide just the right amount of support while keeping you cool and comfortable. Also suitable as a chiropractic, cpap, anti snoring or beauty salon anti wrinkle aging lash pillow. Please note that our pillow is Firm, and dimensions are 23.5\" x 13\" x 4.5\" Ideal Shape For Comfortable Nights: Designed to bring maximum comfort to your bed, this ultra-soft neck pillows for pain relief sleeping features an exclusive design that will gently cradle your neck and head to keep you from tossing and turning while keeping your head upright and in line with your spine to reduce arm, neck arthritis, sciatica and frozen shoulder rotator cuff pain and soreness post surgery. Our pillows also have unique armrests to cushion and support your shoulders. Designed To Fit Your Life: Whether you sleep on your side, back or stomach, our cervical pillows for neck pain will fit into your life. They come with a luxurious outer cover in a modern white and blue mesh design that will look great with any set of bed sheets. Plus, the inner cover keeps the memory foam clean and protects from particles so that it is safe for you and everyone in your family. Our Gift To You: At CushionCare, we want to make sure you have everything you need for a restful night’s sleep - which is why we’ve included a free sutera sleeping mask to keep every hint of light out! Additionally, our sleeping pillow comes in its own beautiful, custom box that makes it the perfect gift for yourself, women, men or anyone in your life who needs relief from endless restless nights.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816QiLvLGHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CushionCare","source_asin":"B0B8VFCVG3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8VFCVG3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8VFCVG3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
