window.products.push({"id":305442,"name":"Scandic Decor Rustic Floating Shelves for Wall | Set of 3 Pine Wood Shelves (24\"x7) White Wooden Shelf with Invisible Brackets, Towel Bar, S-Hooks & B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DMiW5AYYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOLID MULTIFUNCTIONAL ELEGANT Rustic Shelves - Elevate your house interior exquisite with our 100% solid pine wood of the highest grade which is handcrafted and stained to give a special rustic farmhouse look to feel the nature HASSLE-FREE INSTALLATION - No sagging and tilting issues anymore. Our long floating shelf comes with solid iron floating brackets and exceptional wall fixtures, helping you mount with ease GET YOUR SPACE OPTIMIZE - Upgrade the aesthetic of your kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, and office space with our wood floating shelves and customize storage space with our towel bar and forged S-hooks QUALITY IS OUR STRENGTH - Our floating wood shelves firmly hold up to 40 lbs. and are quality assured for sturdiness and handmade. We proudly stand behind our product, if you face any problem, we are here for you AN IDEAL HOUSEWARMING GIFT – The Stylish decorative iron corners perfectly blend with the floating shelves wood and add a unique vintage rustic experience. Great value addition for aesthetic lovers VERSATILE ACCESSORIES - We Help you Enhance decorum while reducing clutter without occupying additional floor space with our customizable accessories of floating wall shelf as your desired needs in living spaces SINGLE BRACKET MOUNTING - Our floating wall shelves come with a heavy-duty single mounting bracket system that is convenient in assembly and flush this wooden shelf against the wall AT SCANDIC DECOR, WE’RE PASSIONATE - about crafting Stunning Home Decor that strikes the perfect balance of Premium Quality, Unique Design and Practical Functionality. If for any reason you don’t love your wood floating shelves, please REACH OUT so we can make it right. PACKAGE DETAILS - The specification of the pine board is 24L x 7W x 1.3H inches. Package includes 3 pine boards, 3 metal brackets, 1 metal frame with guardrail (storage shelve), 1 towel rack, 9 long set screws (for metal wall bracket), 9 drywall plastic anchors, 10 small screws (for fixing storage/towel bar), 8 black metal S-Hooks, 1 black metal set of bookend, 1 installation manual and 1 green small level","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DMiW5AYYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SCANDIC DECOR","source_asin":"B091V2Q4Z6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091V2Q4Z6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091V2Q4Z6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305443,"name":"Silicone Popsicle Molds, 7-cavity DIY Ice Pop Mold with Colorful Plastic Sticks, Popsicle Makers for Egg Bites, Lollipop and Ice Cream Mould, Baby Foo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R-Ms9cH5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"🍦【Material Safety】 The silicone popsicle molds is made from food grade silicone mold and premium plastic sticks, safe to make various kind of food. They are of high quality, soft and durable. In addition, temperature range from -40 to 446F, safe to use in the condition of oven and fridge. 🍦【Colorful】 Each mold has 7 different grids in different colors. Easy to distinguish the taste. Each silicone popsicle mold is equipped with a silicone cover and 7 sticks. You can make a variety of flavors at one time. It has strong sealing and is not easy to change the taste. 🍦【Multifunctional】 Our silicone popsicle molds is very versatile, perfect for making a mini ice pop, egg bites, chocolate candy, mousse, chocolate, lollipop, baby good, ice cream, frozen yogurt, ice cubes with fruit juice, jelly for a party, birthdays, baby showers, family gathering and so much more! 🍦【Easy to use and clean up】 Simply add food into the mold, waiting for some time, you will get mini pops,lollipop or other food. The silicone egg bite molds are soft and non-stick which makes the food can be easily to pop out. And you just need to wash the egg bite molds with warm water and rinse with clear water after using. 🍦【Drip Guard】 Simply pull out your popsicle and enjoy. Each mini silicone popsicle mold includes a stick with drip guard for mess-free enjoyment and keep your hands clean that make sure enjoy popsicle, create unique and healthy treats.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R-Ms9cH5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SGQCAR","source_asin":"B088H89WJM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088H89WJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088H89WJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
