window.products.push({"id":305526,"name":"Sherpa Fleece Blanket Throw, Bed Blanket for Winter | Plush Microfiber Lightweight Travel Blanket Cozy Softest Warm Thick | Thermal Fuzzy Blanket for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VoVMMw1TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE QUALITY WE'RE FAMOUS FOR - Ultra fluffy FLEECE + warm SHERPA fabric on flip side. Our SOFTEST blanket ever is ready for snuggle. Great for indoor or outdoor use, snuggie yourself into a burrito blanket with a book & hot cup of tea. Microfiber faux-sheepskin cashmere reversible to ultra-plush velvet. Feel to believe & Cuddle & Experience ultimate comfort w/ super soft thick shag material on top and feel cozy day & night. DIMENSIONS 60 x 80 in: large enough size to wrap adults or kids – Super soft throw blanket perfect for relaxing & watching TV on couch, sofa, sectional or bed. This is THE BEST throw blanket to gift for all-Year, any season. Perfect fuzzy blanket for teenage girls, women, men gifts, grandparents gifts, friend gifts, wife gifts, family gifts, sister gifts, mom christmas gifts, grandma gifts & white elephant gifts ideas ADD STYLE TO YOUR HOME – Come in choice of 3 beautiful colors (Navy Blue, Burgendy, Charcoal Gray) Let's face it people, you need a blanket thats multi-functional! Our LIGHTWEIGHT ultra-comfortable sherpa throw offers an elegant look, rich velvet cashmere & beautiful white faux sheepskin. The ultimate choice as a decor drape it over your bedspread to add sophistication in the bedroom, living room, lounge, vacation home or the house. EASY CARE - Made with 100% US Certified microfiber polyester, making our throw blanket resistant to shed or pill. The SNUZ blanket is machine washable, please wash in the washing machine on cold, delicate cycle with gentle detergent (no bleach). Tumble dry on air dry or low. RISK FREE GUARANTEE: We are proud of our products, because we know how well our blankets were made. If you don't 100% love our blanket, then its 100% money back guarantee. Just contact us directly (even if outside the Amazon return window) for a replacement or a full refund. No questions asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VoVMMw1TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SNUZZZZ","source_asin":"B076F2H822","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076F2H822","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076F2H822","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305527,"name":"Wooden Tablespoon 'Khokhloma'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41s4KwkT+5L._AC_.jpg","description":"Khokhloma is one of the oldest Russian crafts, dating back to the 17th century. Its authentic and unique methods of hand-carving, painting, and gilding wood products remain the same today. Artists work without stencils to apply designs that are one of a kind. This beautiful table spoon features the Semyonov Khokhloma Painting trademark, which guarantees that it's authentic and high quality. Housewares with this trademark are made exclusively with natural materials and dyes and are certified suitable for everyday use. You will find a spoon, bowl, or cup with Khokhloma painting in virtually every Russian home. Khokhloma items always make valuable gifts, adding charm to any home or table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41s4KwkT+5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Khokhloma Painting","source_asin":"B005SFREGA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005SFREGA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005SFREGA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305528,"name":"Superhero Comics Beer Mug, Comics Stein, Comics Fan Wedding Gift, Personalized Beer Stein, Gifts For Him, Custom Gift for Men","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sZWBEM7sS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mark your loved ones' special occasions with a unique, personalized present. Are you looking for a special gift to give to a special person - a friend, family member, spouse or colleague? Aren't you tired of the impractical, unremarkable and forgettable presents people usually resort to in these cases? Would you like to see a unique, personalized and memorable gift that everyone can appreciate and enjoy? Our beer mugs is just exactly what you're looking for! This wooden beer stein is made to our high quality standards - handmade oak wood mug accomplished in a dark brown color. The stainless steel cup inside the wooden casing of the mug will keep the temperature of the beer colder, for a longer period of time during the summer. Nothing says “cheers” like the end of a hard day and a drink with mates! Our mugs will elevate any home bar into a respect-worthy collection. Keep your favorite spirit in style with this generously sized and expertly crafted steins. We can also engrave your personal image on the copper label, just write us a message!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sZWBEM7sS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WildMugs","source_asin":"B07YMVQVRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YMVQVRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YMVQVRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305529,"name":"Safco Products 9371BL Twist Outdoor/Indoor Covered Top Plastic Trash Can/Waste Recepticle, 32-Gallon Capacity, Touch-Free Disposal, Weather Resistant,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":166.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kFois4yvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With an ample 32-gallon capacity and a distinct modern look, the weather-resistant Twist Trash Can offers reliable outdoor or indoor waste collection in a sleek design perfect for patios, entryways, breakrooms, lobbies and more. Made from high-density polyethylene plastic with built-in UV inhibitors for better color fade resistance, the Twist trash can offers long-lasting durability and features a fluted panel design that complements any contemporary décor. Designed to help defend the interior from pesky precipitation like rain and snow, the covered top of the Twist trash can also helps keep the collected waste inside better shrouded and less noticeable to guests, visitors, clients and colleagues. Two openings on opposite sides of the can allow for simple, touch-free garbage toss-ins from more than one direction, making the Twist ideal for busy indoor or outdoor environments with multiple traffic paths. For windier outdoor environments or for when the Twist may be bumped into or moved, you can add simple weights like bricks or sand to the bottom of the can, or you can use your own anchoring devices to help it better stay in place - weights and anchors not included. When it's time to change the Twist's bag, simply lift off the lid, wrap the new bag over the ridged top of the base, then put it back together. The lid helps keep the bag from sliding down while also hiding the edge for a cleaner, more organized appearance. Like the eye-catching contours of the Twist Covered Top Trash Can but need something with a lower profile? Check out the Twist Open Top Trash Can – it's got the same modern look but with a shorter stance and just a single opening on top. No Assembly Required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kFois4yvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Safco","source_asin":"B09KLGNT1Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305529","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KLGNT1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KLGNT1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
