window.products.push({"id":305539,"name":"Heyouou Nowaday Gnomes - Ooh Rah Marine Gnome Military Soldier Dress Blues with Sword Home & Garden Gnome Statue 14\" H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ApJswJH+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Homestyles - Nowaday Gnomes - American Pride Collection-\"Ooh Rah\" Marine 14\"H Military Soldier Gnome in dress blues with sword while sporting that famous hat and those special shoes that are naturally curved at the toe as he is a gnome, don't ya' know, and a Nowaday Gnome to-boot! Legend has it; Nowaday Gnomes occupy a parallel universe to our own, living quietly among us, they have mimicked our evolution throughout time, from scavenging for food with rocks and clubs in the ice-age to shopping and sharing emoji's on smartphones and tablets today, they have evolved as we have evolved, done everything we have done, coveted everything we have coveted, and enjoy everything we enjoy, especially \"American Pride\"! \"Nowaday Gnomes\" love the to be Military HEROS-especially a Marine Soldier, too which begs the question; who is mimicking whom? A whimsical reminder that \"they\" are living among us. Other key features include; made of durable cast resin, hand painted, suitable for indoor & outdoor use, realistic UV resistant color paint finish, great gift for the military lover in your family, work, and neighborhood. Made for both the garden and home decor statue decor. They're Not Your Garden Variety Gnomes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ApJswJH+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heyouou","source_asin":"B077DWJD9J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077DWJD9J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077DWJD9J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305540,"name":"Handmade Yixing Zisha Tea Set,Large Capacity Ceramic Teapot with Set of 4 Tea Cups,Faucet Ruyi Tea Pot,14oz/400ml","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+SZebbT1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"About Yixing Zisha Teapot The first Zisha teapot was created during the Song Dynasty in the 10th century .A monk in Yixing handmade the teapot from local clay. Today, Zisha teapots produced in Yixing City are considered to be the best tool for making tea. Use & Maintenance They are meant for use with black and oolong teas, green or white tea as well as aged pu'er tea, but the water must be allowed to cool to around 185 degree(F)before pouring the water into the pot.  The using steps as follow:  1. When use the teapot at the first time, put the teapot into clean pot with cold water and boiling for about 5-10 minutes. Then remove the pot from the boiling water and set aside for natural cooling. This step can open the pores of teapot and make the tea more breathable.  2. Please put the tea into the Zisha pot and brew with warm water around 185 degree(F),wait for some minutes to enjoy your tea either by pouring it into a cup or by drinking directly from the Zisha teapot, which is the traditional way of using it.  Yixing teapots absorb a tiny amount of tea into the pot during brewing. After prolonged use, the pot will develop a coating that retains the flavor and color of the tea. It should be rinsed with fresh water and allowed to air-dry. A studious tea connoisseur will only steep one type of tea in a particular pot, so as not to corrupt the flavor that has been absorbed.(NOTE: FORBIDDEN IN MICROWAVE ,OVEN OR DISHWASHER) How to identify The Yixing teapot is good or bad can be judged from five aspects: raw clay type,modeling ,feature ,craftsman ,function. According to the special requirements of the teapot forming crafts, the spout and the pot handle should be absolutely in line, and the weight should be balanced; the combination of the spout and the lid should be tight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+SZebbT1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ufengke","source_asin":"B07MNVJQWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MNVJQWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MNVJQWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
