window.products.push({"id":305700,"name":"Pearhead Chaos Coordinator Stainless Steel Wine Tumbler with Press-In and Slide Locking Lid, Mother’s Day Stemless Wine Glass Tumbler Mug, New Mom Acc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+NvdiWJpL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Celebrate mom and all that she does with this adorable “chaos coordinator” wine tumbler by Pearhead, perfect for at home or on-the-go! Whether mama needs coffee, wine, or her favorite cocktail this mom mug is sure to quickly become her favorite go-to glass! Welcoming a little one into the family is a momentous occasion for everyone in your family, especially mom! Make sure the new mother is ready to celebrate and raise a toast for your new baby girl or baby boy with this timeless mom gift. Mom will love having this drink tumbler to show off her special mommy and baby bond. Includes one double walled stainless steel stemless wine travel tumbler mug with splash resistant, press in lid and sliding closure, BPA free. This tumbler comes in a beautiful pastel pink matte color with bold “chaos coordinator” multicolor print. Whether you’re celebrating a new pregnancy, a new baby’s arrival, or the childhood of your little ones, this is the perfect everyday mom accessory for mom to have every step of the way! This giftable travel mug is the perfect new mom gift, wife gift, gift for women, Mother’s Day gift, holiday gift, birthday gift, new baby gift, baby shower gift, pregnancy announcement prop, baby arrival announcement prop or addition to your own baby shower registry. Moms will love this adorable mom tumbler and the sentiment behind it. Motherhood can be hard and there’s no better way to relax and unwind after a day spent with your little girl or little boy than by sipping on your favorite wine, tea, coffee or cocktail out of this insulated tumbler. At Pearhead, we aim to create genuine, quality products to celebrate your special moments in life. We are a family of designers, marketers, and trendsetters bringing products to life that will bring a smile to your face. From concept and design to production and customer service, the Pearhead team works together seamlessly every step of the way. Whether your baby is celebrating their first year of life, you are announcing your pregnancy, or your pup is celebrating his first holiday season, Pearhead is here to share your moment in style. Dimensions: 3.43”W x 4.57”H x 3.43”D, holds 12 fluid ounces, handwash only, not microwave safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+NvdiWJpL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pearhead","source_asin":"B09W3F31XN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W3F31XN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W3F31XN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
