window.products.push({"id":305742,"name":"Ner Mitzvah Colorful Chanukah Candles 1-Pack - Standard Size Fits Most Menorahs - Premium Quality Wax - Assorted Colors - Bulk Pack for All 8 Nights o","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PGS1KbLpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LIGHT UP THE NIGHT A favorite for so many, celebrating Chanuka is a highlight of the year. Of all the holiday traditions, kindling the Menorah is the main event. Lighting the candles while reciting the blessings and singing traditional hymns brings family and friends together to celebrate, young and old alike. Ner Mitzvah’s variety of Chanukah candles allows you to choose a size, color and design that you love to celebrate the holiday in style. Whether you prefer a classic, standard size white, natural beeswax, fun multi-color assortments or funky themes, we have the perfect candles to put the finishing touches on your menora and make it look spectacular. Celebrate the Festival of Lights with plenty of candles to last you through all 8 nights, just like the miraculous oil jug in the Holy Temple. Our 44-count boxes suffice to light one menorah, including the shamash, on each night of the chag. PRODUCT FEATURES: - Bulk Pack, 50 individual boxes - Kosher & Meets All Halachic Requirements - 3.5\" (90 mm) - Stays Lit At Least 30 Minutes - Premium Quality Wax - 5/16” (8 mm) Standard Size Fits Most Menorahs - Multi Color - 44 Count per Box, 50 Packs CUSTOMIZE YOUR CANDLES Kindle the perfect Chanuka candles to complement your chanukiya & create a dazzling display! Choose from Ner Mitzvahs full line of: - Short 4” or Long 9” - Multicolored, Classic, Metallic, Pastel or Natural - Straight & Smooth, Spiral, Wavy, Criss-Cross - Beeswax or Honeycomb - Dreidel or “Happy Chanukah” Art ABOUT NER MITZVAH Family-operated since the 1940’s, Ner Mitzvah is an expert candle-maker, delivering a wide selection of products at the highest quality with personal customer service. Count on us for Shabbat, Havdalah, and Chanukah candles and oil lamps as well as related Judaica.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PGS1KbLpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ner Mitzvah","source_asin":"B0BR8J7LHG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR8J7LHG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR8J7LHG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
