window.products.push({"id":305745,"name":"BESKAR USB Small Desk Fan, Portable Fans with 3 Speeds Strong Airflow, Quiet Operation and 360°Rotate, Personal Table Fan for Home,Office, Bedroom No ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vXlV3m1fL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"【Small Desk Fan for Office & Home】- The BESKAR USB desk fan has 3 speeds & 360 °Rotation Adjustment, allowing cooling at various angles and improving airflow in small rooms. Equipped with 4 rubber pads under the fans, will not damage the desktop, nor will it slip. Perfect fan for desk. 【Strong Airflow & Ultra Quiet】- The USB desk fans built-in professional brushless motor with faster operating speed. Feel the blast of the strong airflow from 10 ft away. Unique turbo blade design engineered to be 25% Quieter. The minimum noise of fan is close to 20dB. It's powerful enough for a cool breeze and quiet operating, gives you a comfortable work environment. 【High Compatibility USB-powered 】- The small desk fan is powered by USB and compatible with PC/laptop, power bank, AC adapter, wall charger and other USB-enabled power supply.USB fan is energy-saving and environmentally friendly. (Note:USB Cord Powered Fan, No Battery and doesn't Charge) 【Compact & Portable USB Fans】- 5.5*5.4*2.5 inch mini size and 6.9 oz lightweight. Portable fans are easily carried in bag when you go out or travel and perfect for office, home, dorm, camping, library use, etc. 【Stable Quality & 18-Month Warranty】- Updated motor, certified, safety-tested, safety & stable & durable. You will get 6-inch USB table fan , Micro USB cable, welcome guide, our worry-free 18-month warranty and friendly customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vXlV3m1fL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BESKAR","source_asin":"B097TFNGC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097TFNGC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097TFNGC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305746,"name":"Historic Charleston King Charles Matelasse Standard Sham, Birch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MUkPw4dKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Steeped in Historic Charleston's rich, classic style and decorative arts culture, the King Charles 100-Percent cotton matelasse bedding collection offers the ultimate blend of European, Caribbean, and Asian influences. King Charles matelasse bedding offers a luxuriously soft bedspread, coverlet, bedskirt, shams and decorative accent pillows featuring classic 19th century motifs representing the sun, a topiary, a pheasant, and a pineapple. The superior design of King Charles matelasse can be traced back to England circa 1820, incorporating key influences from that time period including the fine arts and quality craftsmanship. Each individual piece is constructed on a special weaving loom to create the luxurious design that defines this lovely classic matelasse collection. Highs and lows created during the jacquard weaving process allow the motifs and sourrounding designs to come to life. Intricate details including rolling arches, half moons, double diamonds and scrolling vines come together to create this beautiful collection. Coverlet and bedspread drape beautifully over the bed to reveal rounded corners. Pair the bedspread with bedskirt to create a complete look. Add coordinating, decorative shams and pillows to create the ultimate bedroom oasis. The heavy-weight, stonewashed matelasse of King Charles bedding ensures life-long durability and style for generations to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MUkPw4dKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Historic Charleston","source_asin":"B00537IX36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00537IX36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00537IX36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
