window.products.push({"id":305751,"name":"Portable Blender for Shakes and Smoothies, Upgraded Personal Blender with 6 Blades, Smoothie Blender, Mini Blender, Portable Blender Usb Rechargeable,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bKvpIooyL._AC_.jpg","description":"Do you want to enjoy a healthy smoothie or juice on the go or on a busy morning? You need our upgraded PORTABLE BLENDER FOR SHAKES AND SMOOTHIES！ 👉 Our portable blender has a powerful motor base & 6 sharp stainless steel blades, it can easily blends fruits and vegetables in 40 seconds. 👉 Portable smoothie blender cup is made of thickened high-quality food grade non-toxic PP+ABS material, which is BPA-free and more durable.  👉 Portable blender usb rechargeable can be fully charged within 3 hours via any USB port and can produce up 10-12 cups of juice when fully charged. 👉 Smoothie blender takes both aesthetics and practicality into account, it is as easy to carry around as a water bottle that can hold 350ml of juice. 👉 Travel blender has a built-in large volume USB rechargeable battery and can recharge via any USB port, very suitable for home, travel, sports & outdoors. 👉 Double opening detachable design makes small blender easy to use and clean, you can open the cap to drink and open the bottom to put fruits in. Smart Safety Protection Design: ● Our mini blender for shakes and smoothies adopts upgraded intelligent power-off protection: ● If the bottom and the blender cup are not tightened tightly, the red light at the bottom will keep flashing and the personal blender won’t work. ● Please fix the bottom and the blender cup in place, when the pink blender’s indicator light flashes blue, you can double click the switch to start. How to Use: Step 1. Cut the fruit into small pieces and put them into the blender cup. Step 2. Add milk or other liquid to submerge the fruit and tightly tighten the bottom and the blender cup. Step 3. When the blue light at the bottom flashes, click the button twice to start . Step 4. Finished and enjoy your drink. Package Includes: Portable blender*1 Silicone straw*1 Small brush*1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bKvpIooyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VICKJES","source_asin":"B0C1H3GC58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1H3GC58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1H3GC58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
