window.products.push({"id":305842,"name":"Custom Size Golf Flag Frame; Black 416 (flag 13x18, navy mat)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YNdmHXntL._AC_.jpg","description":"THIS ITEM IS FOR BLACK FRAME/ACRYLIC/MATTING ONLY - DOES NOT INCLUDE FLAG! Looking for a way to display that Mint Condition Golf Flag? Order this custom size Flag Holding Frame. Does not accommodate tube style flags. It includes matting to mount your flag, fabric adhesive, clear glazing, backing and bendable tabs for easy frame access. Includes sawtooth hanger and bumpers also. Also includes mounting instructions. The moulding is a smooth black with slight bevel. The width is approximately 7/8\". The height is approximately 1 1/8\". It could cost well over $200 to have your flags mounted in a frame shop. Now you can do it for less then half of that. THIS IS FRAME/MATTING/ACRYLIC/SUPPLIES ONLY - DOES NOT INCLUDE FLAG!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YNdmHXntL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"golfflagframes.com","source_asin":"B01DKYJCV0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DKYJCV0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DKYJCV0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":305843,"name":"Home Styles Lafayette Media Chest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EGLeASoAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"An opulence of design heightens the allure of the Lafayette Bedroom collection. Lafayette Media Chest by Home Styles is inspired by Ancestral traditional design. Mahogany solids with cherry veneers in a rich cherry finish capture and accentuate the ingenious elegant details. The stately Media Chest is adorned with moldings and antiqued brass hardware providing a lavish look for any bedroom. Provides ample storage with four large storage drawers with side mounted easy-glide suspension. The top drawer is felt lined to accommodate lingerie or jewelry. The wood trimmed hutch comes equipped with cable access to meet your multi-media needs. Size is 36-inch wide by 18-inch deep by 42-inch high. Assembly required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EGLeASoAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Styles","source_asin":"B0095FZMAO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0095FZMAO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0095FZMAO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
