window.products.push({"id":305845,"name":"Zulay Kitchen Shot Measure Jigger For Bartending - Cocktail Jigger 18/8 Food-Grade Stainless Steel - Jigger 2 oz 1 oz Etched Markings - Cocktail Measu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eBPHgUESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great Quality: Our stainless steel Japanese double jigger looks and feels every bit the premium product. With its clean lines and brushed finish, this jigger certainly stands out. Accurate and cleanly etched calibration markers go in a complete circumference for more accurate measuring. It has a good heft and balances nicely between your fingers. The cups have enough space left when at full capacity making it easy to pour without spilling a single drop. Perfect Accuracy: Engraved calibration marks inside each cup give you perfect pouring measurements. Large cup holds up to 2oz and has its mark at 1.5oz. Small cup has a capacity of 1oz and has its marks at 0.5oz and 0.75oz. The bell shape is elegant and balances perfectly between two fingers. The steep angles and wide openings make it easy to fill & pour without spilling a single drop. Durable & Secure Materials: Our jigger is crafted with the highest standards. Made of durable 304(18/8), food grade stainless steel. It is certified as dishwasher friendly, making this jigger one of the best alcohol mixer utensils. Budget Friendly: Out jigger is very well priced. Its excellent build & quality are meant to give you a professional air and make your cocktail-making more enjoyable and nuanced. No Hassle, Zulay Guarantee: We love and take pride in our double-sided jigger and we back this up with a lifetime guarantee. Have the confidence that this product will last, if there are ever any issues, just contact us and we will make it right. Order now and be assured that this product will live up to your expectations, guaranteed. If it does not, we got you covered. Chances are, you will never need to reach out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eBPHgUESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B0B4F1CG3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-305845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4F1CG3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4F1CG3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
